        "original_id": "069aeb70-b8ba-5cba-9d0f-8c9da8224e5e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Marine Corps Reserve Ribbon\n- People: James Forrestal\n- Roles: United States Secretary of the Navy, United States Secretary of Defense\n- Organizations: Marine Corps Reserve\n\nFacts:\n- James Forrestal was born on February 15, 1892.\n- James Forrestal was the last Cabinet-level United States Secretary of the Navy and the first United States Secretary of Defense.\n- The Marine Corps Reserve Ribbon was first created by Secretary of the Navy James Forrestal.\n- The Marine Corps Reserve Ribbon recognizes members of the Marine Corps Reserve who performed ten years of honorable reserve service.\n- James Forrestal died on May 22, 1949.",
